  <description>
    <p>PeaSyo, also known as Pixiu, is a PS4/5 streaming client for Windows/MacOS/Linux(steamOS).</p>
    <p>It helps you connect to your console from Linux, macOS, and Windows with a simple setup experience.</p>
  </description>
